  "description": "I’m changing. Wasn’t mermaid meat supposed to be the elixir of immortality? \n\nIn the late Goryeo period, as a noble girl fled from war, the moment she ate mermaid meat to survive, the fates of her twin sister, the villagers where she had newly settled, and a man she came to believe was her destined partner were swept into a turbulent whirlwind… \n\nA girl’s passionate obsession clashes with a man’s burning desire for revenge!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
